            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Enjoy 20% off the regular price of all individual items, including mattress toppers, mattress protectors and sheets.</p><p>During the sale, our usual bundle discount does not apply. Instead, the 20% sale discount is applied to the regular price of each item in the bundle.</p><p>Gift cards are excluded.</p>",
