          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How can I get a free gift with my order?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Spend $350 or more and a free Dreamer RV Cooler Bag will be automatically added to your cart. Spend $490 or more to also receive a free Sand-Free Beach Towel, simply choose your preferred colour in your cart.</p><p>Limit one cooler bag and, where eligible, one towel per order. Gifts and towel colours are subject to availability, while stocks last. T&Cs apply.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_Ga9BcL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
