            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Our warehouse team will be working hard to get orders on their way, but please allow 3–4 business days for dispatch during the sale. All orders are delivered by Australia Post.</p><p>If you’re on a tight timeline, choose Express Post and contact our customer care team after ordering so we can flag your order for priority dispatch. Visit our shipping page for more details.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
