            "faq_answer": "<p>Sale discounts apply to in-stock items only. Sold-out items and products on our waitlist aren’t eligible for sale pricing. We can’t reserve stock or guarantee every size will remain available throughout the sale, so we recommend shopping early.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
