    "section_faq_GkWkc7": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_w8XeKY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How do I work out the right size for my setup?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Caravan beds can be a little tricky — unlike domestic beds, there’s no consistent sizing across caravan makes and models. That’s why we always recommend measuring your mattress rather than relying on whether it’s called a Queen, Double or Single.</p><p>Measure the <strong>width and length of your mattress in millimetres</strong>, including any head-end bolster in the total length, and take note of the corner profile at the foot end of your mattress.</p><p>You can then enter your measurements into our <a href=\"/pages/find-your-fit\">Sizing Calculator</a> to find the best Wanderluxe™ fit for your setup.</p><p>Still unsure? Send your measurements through to our Australian Customer Care team via our <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us Form</a> and we’ll be happy to help.</p><p><strong>Quick Sizing Checklist</strong></p><ul><li>Orientation: Note if your mattress runs north–south or east–west to check for cabinetry or frame limits.</li><li>Corners: Identify if corners are square or rounded – rounded toppers fit both styles.</li><li>Dimensions: Measure width and length across the centre: Include any bolster section in your measurement.</li><li>Fit tip: Choose a topper that’s slightly shorter rather than one that overhangs — overhang can cause shifting or edge compression.</li><li>Overhang: Keep it minimal if unavoidable, and avoid entirely where bunk frames or cabinetry restrict space.</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_qdJEKP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Do you offer custom sizes?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>At this stage, we don’t manufacture one-off custom sizes. Instead, we’ve developed our Wanderluxe™ range in a wide variety of shapes, sizes and corner profiles to suit many of the caravan bed configurations found across Australia.</p><p>Your topper also doesn’t need to be an exact millimetre-for-millimetre match to your mattress to provide a great fit. In many cases, a slightly smaller topper is preferable to one that overhangs your mattress or interferes with surrounding cabinetry.</p><p>Rounded-corner toppers can also be used successfully on many square or cut-corner mattresses.</p><p>Enter your measurements into our <a href=\"/pages/find-your-fit\">Sizing Calculator</a>, or contact our <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Customer Care team</a> if you’d like help finding the closest fit.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_bdpQ8g": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I try a Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper before I buy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>You can experience our Wanderluxe™ Mattress Toppers in person at selected retailers and at caravan and camping shows throughout Australia.</p><p>Visit our <a href=\"/pages/stockists\">Stockists</a> page to find an authorised retailer, or check our <a href=\"/pages/exhibitions-shows\">Exhibitions</a> page for upcoming caravan and camping shows.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_EpXBYk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How long does shipping take?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>We use Australia Post for all deliveries Australia-wide.</p><p>In-stock orders are generally dispatched from our Sydney warehouse within <strong>1–2 business days</strong>. During peak periods, dispatch may take up to <strong>3–4 business days</strong>.</p><p>Delivery times after dispatch depend on your location and whether you select Regular or Express Shipping, with regional and remote areas generally taking a little longer.</p><p>Enter your postcode at checkout to view an estimated delivery timeframe. Once your order has been dispatched, you’ll receive tracking details by email and Australia Post will provide the most up-to-date delivery estimate.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
