    "faq_04": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q_04_01": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "What does the Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper feel like?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Our Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper is made from <strong>50mm gel-infused memory foam</strong> with a medium-soft feel, designed to add an extra layer of cushioning and comfort to a firm caravan mattress.</p><p>The memory foam gently conforms to your body to help relieve pressure, while the gel infusion helps with temperature regulation for a more comfortable night’s sleep.</p><p>Soft, supportive and made for life on the road — it’s all about making your caravan bed somewhere you genuinely look forward to climbing into.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_02": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "What is the Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper made from?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>The topper is made from premium polyurethane memory foam with a medium-soft feel.</p><p>It is infused with cooling gel to assist with temperature regulation and covered with a soft Tencel/polyester zippered cover.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_03": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How firm is the Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Our Wanderluxe™ Mattress Toppers use <strong>medium-soft memory foam</strong>, designed to add cushioning and comfort to a firm caravan mattress while still providing support.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_04": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How thick is the Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>The Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper is <strong>50mm thick</strong>, providing a comfortable layer of memory foam without adding unnecessary bulk to your caravan setup.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_05": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How much does a Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper weigh?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Weights vary depending on the topper dimensions.</p><p>As an example, the Caravan Queen Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper weighs approximately <strong>7.5kg</strong>.</p><p>For the exact weight and specifications of a particular size, scroll down on the relevant product page and open the <strong>Specifications</strong> section.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_06": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Is the foam CertiPUR-US® certified?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes! All the Wanderluxe™️ Mattress Toppers are made with <a href=\"https://certipur.us/directory/\">CertiPUR-US®</a> certified foam.</p><p>This means that the foam inside the cover has been tested to meet CertiPUR-US® rigorous standards for emissions, content, performance and durability.</p><p>Specifically, the foam is:</p><ul><li>Made without formaldehyde</li><li>Made without ozone depleters</li><li>Made without phthalates regulated by the U.S. Consumer Product Safety Commission</li><li>Made without mercury, lead and other heavy metals</li><li>Low VOC (volatile organic compound) emissions for indoor air quality (less than 0.5 parts per million)</li><li>Screened for relevant chemicals, including flame retardants, that are classified as carcinogens, mutagens or reproductive toxins and are harmful to human health</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_07": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Is the Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper OEKO-TEX® certified?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. Wanderluxe™ Mattress Toppers carry <strong>OEKO-TEX® STANDARD 100 certification</strong>, which means the certified materials and components have been independently tested for harmful substances.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_08": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can the topper help relieve pressure points?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>The memory foam gently conforms to your body and can help distribute pressure more evenly, making a firm caravan mattress feel more comfortable.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_09": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Will the topper make a firm caravan mattress more comfortable?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>That is exactly what it has been designed to do.</p><p>The medium-soft memory foam adds a cushioning comfort layer over a firm mattress while maintaining support.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_10": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "I’m a hot sleeper. Will memory foam make me hotter?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Our memory foam is infused with cooling gel to help regulate temperature.</p><p>Everyone experiences sleeping temperature differently, so individual results can vary, but the gel infusion is designed to help create a more comfortable sleeping environment.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_11": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "What does the cooling gel do?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>The gel infusion helps with temperature regulation while you sleep.</p><p>It is designed to reduce heat build-up compared with traditional memory foam and help maintain a more comfortable sleeping temperature.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_12": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Will the gel make the topper cold in winter?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>No. The cooling gel is designed to assist with temperature regulation rather than make the topper feel cold.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_13": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Will the topper reduce partner movement?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Memory foam naturally absorbs and isolates movement, which can help reduce the amount of movement transferred across the bed when your partner moves during the night.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_14": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Will the topper move or slide?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>The Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper features an <strong>anti-slip underside and securing straps</strong> to help keep it comfortably in place.</p><p>For the best grip, the topper should sit on a <strong>firm, flat mattress surface</strong> and fit within the mattress edges as closely as possible. Excessive overhang can allow the foam to flex over the edge of the mattress and may contribute to movement, which is why we generally recommend a slightly smaller topper rather than one that is too large.</p><p>The surface of your existing mattress can also make a difference. Very soft, cushioned or pillow-top mattresses may not provide as much grip for the anti-slip base as a firmer, flatter mattress.</p><p>Making sure all straps are fitted securely and choosing the closest possible fit will help minimise movement during use.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_04_15": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I use an electric blanket?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. Your electric blanket should be placed <strong>on top of the Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper and Mattress Protector, underneath your fitted sheet</strong>.</p><p>Always check the care and safety instructions supplied by your electric blanket manufacturer to ensure it is suitable for use with a memory foam topper.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
