    "faq_05": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q_05_01": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Which Waterproof Mattress Protector should I choose?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Where possible, choose the Waterproof Mattress Protector designed to match your Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper size.</p><p>However, the topper and protector do not always need to be the same size. In some setups, we may recommend a topper that is slightly smaller than the mattress to avoid overhang. If your mattress is longer than the topper, or has a different corner profile, the protector still needs to be large enough and shaped appropriately to fit over the <strong>mattress itself</strong>.</p><p>For example, a mattress with square corners may need a square-corner protector even if a rounded topper is the best fit.</p><p>If you’re unsure which size is best, check our <a href=\"/pages/find-your-fit\">Sizing Calculator</a> or contact our Customer Care team with your mattress dimensions and corner profile and we’ll help you find the most suitable option.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_05_02": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Will the protector fit over both my mattress and topper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. Our protectors feature either a <strong>200mm or 300mm elastic skirt</strong>, depending on the size, designed to fit securely over your mattress and topper together.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_05_03": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Is the Dreamer RV Mattress Protector waterproof?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. The sleep surface has a waterproof TPU backing designed to protect the mattress and topper underneath from spills and accidents.</p><p>The fitted side panels are designed to stretch around your bed and are <strong>not waterproof</strong>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_05_04": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Are the protectors noisy or crinkly?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>No. Our Waterproof Mattress Protectors are designed with a soft, flexible waterproof backing for a quiet and comfortable sleeping surface.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_05_05": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "What is the Waterproof Mattress Protector made from?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>The upper fabric is made from a soft <strong>Tencel/polyester blend</strong>, with a <strong>TPU waterproof backing</strong> underneath.</p><p>Together, these materials provide a soft, breathable sleep surface with reliable waterproof protection.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
