          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Do you sell sheets to fit caravan mattresses and toppers?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. MeanderWild offers caravan bedding designed to complement many of the shapes and sizes across our Wanderluxe™ range.</p><p>We stock a selection of the MeanderWild range on our website, making it easy to pair your topper with sheets designed for caravan beds.</p>",
