        "q_06_02": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I buy sheets without purchasing a topper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. MeanderWild sheets can be purchased separately.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_06_03": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Do you offer bedding bundles?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. MeanderWild offers caravan bedding designed to complement many of the shapes and sizes across our Wanderluxe™ range.</p><p>With our <a href=\"/collections/bundles-1\">Build Your Bundle</a> option, you can choose the topper, protector and sheet sizes that best suit your mattress setup, with bundle savings applied as you add more items to your cart.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_06_04": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Where can I see the full MeanderWild range?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>You can explore the complete range through the MeanderWild collection on their website.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
