    "faq_07": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q_07_01": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Do you sell complete caravan mattresses?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>No. Dreamer RV specialises in mattress toppers, protectors and complementary bedding rather than complete mattresses.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_07_02": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I use a Wanderluxe™ Topper on my bed at home?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Absolutely. Our <a href=\"/collections/home-comfort-range\">Wanderluxe™ Home Comfort Range</a> is designed specifically for beds at home, bringing the same premium comfort you love on the road into your everyday sleep setup.</p><p>If one of the Home Comfort sizes isn’t the right fit, you can also choose the most suitable option from our caravan range by matching your mattress dimensions as closely as possible.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_07_03": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Do you have bunk sizes?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. We offer several topper sizes designed to suit caravan bunks and smaller single beds.</p><p>Because bunk dimensions vary considerably, always measure your bunk mattress before choosing a size.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_07_04": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Do you offer sizes for east-west beds?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. We offer several options suitable for east-west caravan beds.</p><p>Measure your mattress and use our <a href=\"/pages/find-your-fit\">Sizing Calculator</a> to find the closest fit.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_07_05": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Are you planning to release more sizes?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Our range continues to evolve as we identify commonly requested caravan mattress dimensions.</p><p>From time to time, new sizes are introduced based on customer demand and product development.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_07_06": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "What does joining a Priority List mean?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>A Priority List allows you to register your interest in a particular size and receive updates when stock or a new release becomes available.</p><p>Joining a Priority List does not automatically reserve or purchase a topper unless specifically advised.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
