    "faq_08": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q_08_01": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How long will my order take to arrive?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>In-stock orders are generally dispatched from our Sydney warehouse within <strong>1–2 business days,</strong> with dispatch extending to <strong>3–4 business days</strong> during peak periods.</p><p>Delivery times after dispatch depend on your location and whether you select Regular or Express Shipping. Enter your postcode at checkout to view the Australia Post delivery estimate for your order.</p><p>Express orders are prioritised for dispatch, but a particular delivery date cannot be guaranteed.</p><p>For full dispatch and delivery information, visit our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Information page</a>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_08_02": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How can I track my order?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>You’ll receive your Australia Post tracking information by email once your order has been dispatched.</p><p>Tracking may take a little time to show movement while your parcel is being scanned into the Australia Post network.</p><p>We also recommend using an Australia Post MyPost account with the same email address used for your order so you can access the latest tracking and delivery updates.</p><p>For more information, visit our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Information page</a>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_08_03": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I have my order delivered while I’m on the road?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Absolutely. If you don’t have a fixed delivery address, <a href=\"https://auspost.com.au/personal/receiving/parcel-deliveries/parcel-collect\">Australia Post Parcel Collect</a> is a great option while you’re travelling.</p><p>Choose a participating Post Office through your MyPost account and have your order sent there ready for collection.</p><p>We recommend choosing a location far enough ahead in your itinerary to allow time for both dispatch and delivery.</p><p>For step-by-step Parcel Collect information and tips for travelling with your order, head on over to our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Information page</a>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_08_04": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Do you ship to New Zealand?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes. We offer <strong>Regular</strong> Shipping to New Zealand for a flat <strong>$30 per order.</strong></p><p>For full shipping information, visit our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Information page</a>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "q_08_01",
        "q_08_02",
        "q_08_03",
        "q_08_04"
      ],
      "name": "Ordering & Delivery",
      "settings": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "compact": true,
        "eyebrow": "",
        "title": "<h2>Ordering & Delivery</h2>",
        "body_text": "<p>For full details on dispatch timeframes, shipping options, delivery estimates, tracking and travelling with your order, head on over to our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Information page</a>.</p>",
        "title_underline_style": "none",
        "show_button": false,
        "button_label": "Read more",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_bg": "#2f8f86",
        "button_text_color": "#ffffff",
        "spacing_desktop": 80,
        "spacing_mobile": 60,
        "fix_zindex": 0
      }
    },
    "faq_09": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q_09_01": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "I ordered the wrong size. What should I do?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>If you’ve ordered the wrong size, please contact our Customer Care team before returning your item.</p><p>We don’t process direct exchanges, so the original item will need to be returned in accordance with our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Returns Policy</a>, and a new order placed separately for the correct size.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_09_02": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "What is your returns policy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Eligible products can be returned within <strong>30 days of purchase</strong>. Return shipping is the customer’s responsibility and a <strong>$25 handling fee</strong> applies to accepted returns.</p><p>For full eligibility requirements, return instructions and terms and conditions, please refer to our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Returns Policy</a>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_09_03": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How long is the Dreamer RV warranty?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Dreamer RV products are covered by a <strong>2-year warranty against manufacturing faults</strong>.</p><p>For full details, including what’s covered and how to make a claim, head on over to our <a href=\"/pages/warranty\">Warranty</a> page.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "q_09_01",
        "q_09_02",
        "q_09_03"
      ],
      "name": "Returns, Warranty & Ordering Issues",
      "settings": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "compact": true,
        "eyebrow": "",
        "title": "<h2>Returns, Warranty & Ordering Issues</h2>",
        "body_text": "<p>For full details on returns, eligibility and associated costs, head on over to our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Returns Policy</a> page. For warranty information, including what’s covered and how to make a claim, visit our <a href=\"/pages/warranty\">Warranty</a> page.</p>",
        "title_underline_style": "none",
        "show_button": false,
        "button_label": "Read more",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_bg": "#2f8f86",
        "button_text_color": "#ffffff",
        "spacing_desktop": 80,
        "spacing_mobile": 60,
        "fix_zindex": 0
      }
    },
    "faq_10": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q_10_01": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I wash the Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>The <strong>memory foam core cannot be machine washed or submerged in water</strong>. If needed, it can be spot cleaned and must be allowed to dry thoroughly before the cover is replaced.</p><p>The topper also has a <strong>removable, machine-washable cover</strong>.</p><p>For complete washing, drying and care instructions, head on over to our <a href=\"/pages/wash-care-guide\">Wash &amp; Care Guide</a>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_10_02": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How should I care for my Waterproof Mattress Protector?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Our Waterproof Mattress Protectors are machine washable and designed for easy everyday care.</p><p>For full washing, drying and care instructions, including which products to avoid, visit our <a href=\"/pages/wash-care-guide\">Wash &amp; Care Guide</a>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "q_10_03": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How should I store my topper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>For longer periods of non-use, we recommend storing your topper <strong>flat or gently rolled</strong>, rather than leaving it tightly folded or compressed.</p><p>Make sure the topper is completely dry before storing it.</p><p>For more tips on folding, storage and everyday use, head on over to our <a href=\"/pages/wash-care-guide\">Wash &amp; Care Guide</a>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "q_10_01",
        "q_10_02",
        "q_10_03"
      ],
      "name": "Wash, Care & Everyday Use",
      "settings": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "compact": true,
        "eyebrow": "",
        "title": "<h2>Wash, Care & Everyday Use</h2>",
        "body_text": "<p>For everything you need to know about washing, caring for and looking after your Dreamer RV products, head on over to our <a href=\"/pages/wash-care-guide\">Wash &amp; Care Guide</a>.</p>",
        "title_underline_style": "none",
        "show_button": false,
        "button_label": "Read more",
